1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,100
All right, recruits.

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,969
Welcome to service school.

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,377
This is Lene, your hospitality hostess.

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,290
Hello.

5
00:00:08,373 --> 00:00:10,359
I look forward to working with you.

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,557
Now you hold on just a moment, Commoner.

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:15,557
Who gave you permission to
exploit my servant in this matter?

8
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:16,470
Guilty.

9
00:00:16,553 --> 00:00:18,697
I asked her to find us
a qualified instructor.

10
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,680
You did what?

11
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,677
Nobles like us don't know the
first thing about service.

12
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,657
That's gotta change if
we hope to run a cafe.

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,480
Can you imagine the horror?

14
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:30,637
We can't go into the Foundation Day Fair
without any hosting skills to speak of.

15
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,737
But, thankfully, the problem's solved.

16
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,173
You don't mind, do you?

17
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:39,800
Now then, as I'm sure you're
all aware, I am a commoner.

18
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,240
And I'm a servant as well.

19
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:46,556
I'm sure some of you may find the
idea of being taught by me appalling.

20
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:51,720
However, focusing on status will distract
you from serving your customers properly.

21
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:55,880
And that's why, until their
preparations are complete...

22
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:00,000
You all will address me as instructor!

23
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,470
Lene!

24
00:01:02,553 --> 00:01:04,357
What in the world has gotten into you?

25
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,270
Ridiculous!

26
00:01:05,353 --> 00:01:07,457
You really expect us to
take orders from a commoner?

27
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:09,437
Take instructions from an expert.

28
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,057
How can you say that, Prince Yu?

29
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,669
And then there's this guy.

30
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:16,477
He may be a servant to the royal
family, but he's still a noble,

31
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,860
upturned nose and all.

32
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:20,820
I suppose it's decided then.

33
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,617
We're all counting on your tutelage, Lene.

34
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,053
I'm sorry, Miss Claire.

35
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:27,940
I believe you meant Instructor Lene.

36
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:32,597
Service is about giving everything to your
master and expecting nothing in return.

37
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:35,621
It's an art crafted from
the sincerest compassion.

38
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,620
Read this and enter me when I speak.

39
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:40,100
Yes, Instructor Lene!

40
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,337
What is the essence of a maid's work?

41
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:44,655
Service and devotion, Instructor Lene!

42
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:46,377
The first skill a maid must learn.

43
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:48,197
A polite greeting, Instructor Lene!

44
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,737
Let's hear it all together,
loudly and clearly!

45
00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:52,877
Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!

46
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,997
I can't hear you!

47
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:56,057
Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!

48
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,557
Don't you look at me in the eye!

49
00:01:57,640 --> 00:02:00,052
Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!

50
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,557
Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!

51
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:05,357
I hope you two don't think
you're exempt from all this!

52
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,220
Now, what's more with feeling?

53
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:10,780
Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!

54
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:16,697
Well, that was quite
the ordeal, wasn't it?

55
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:19,737
I never knew you had such a
fearsome alter ego, Linnaeus.

56
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:21,840
I apologize, Miss Clare.

57
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,118
Perhaps I did get a bit overzealous.

58
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:27,480
Even so, I suppose it
shouldn't come as a surprise.

59
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:32,407
You always have been quite different from
the other maids since the day we met.

60
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:34,477
This is your new maid, Miss Clare.

61
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,619
She will be serving you personally.

62
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,269
Go on, introduce yourself.

63
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:40,360
My name is Lene Oriseu.

64
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,245
It's my pleasure to serve you.

65
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:45,040
You think that I care what your name is?

66
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,980
I don't!

67
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:50,492
Why should I when you'll be
quitting within a week anyway?

68
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,285
She was a handful from
the very beginning, huh?

69
00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:58,808
Since her parents were either
busy or traveling all the time,

70
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:02,477
Miss Claire wasn't raised with firm
values or consistent nurturing.

71
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:05,380
She became selfish and hard to manage.

72
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,550
Commoner!

73
00:03:07,633 --> 00:03:09,560
My name is Lene, Miss Claire.

74
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:11,820
I already told you I don't care!

75
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,235
Now stop prattling and become a horse!

76
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,657
A horse, miss?

77
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:20,820
I know you lack education, but
do not even know what a horse is?

78
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:25,060
I know what a horse is, but
why do you want me to be one?

79
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:28,184
Because I'm in the mood
to go riding, obviously.

80
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:30,940
So, get down on your hands and knees now!

81
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:37,240
Miss Claire, please don't
ask me to be a horse.

82
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,520
What did you say?

83
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:41,560
You're supposed to say
yes as you command! No.

84
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:45,317
Why, you little - Because nobles
shouldn't sully themselves that way.

85
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:49,576
I can't allow someone like you to
sit on the back of a lowly, commoner.

86
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:55,137
I'll admit I'm impressed by
how well you know your place.

87
00:03:55,220 --> 00:03:58,455
You might even have long-term
potential here, commoner.

88
00:03:58,780 --> 00:03:59,662
Very well then.

89
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:03,054
I will allow you to serve as
my maid for the time being.

90
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:05,000
Make sure not to disappoint me.

91
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,740
I appreciate it, miss.

92
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:13,797
Aw, even when you were
little you were gullible.

93
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,880
Uh, I mean, you are adorable.

94
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:18,000
Oh no, I heard you insult me.

95
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,437
Don't you try to gloss over it.

96
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,377
And it's funny to think that Lene
has always been this stubborn.

97
00:04:22,460 --> 00:04:24,519
I mean that she's been so reliable.

98
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:28,557
You're gonna be a huge help to
us at the fair, Miss Instructor.

99
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,470
Thank you.

100
00:04:29,553 --> 00:04:30,515
You too, Miss Claire.

101
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,180
Hmm, that goes without saying.

102
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:37,137
If I'm going to bother to learn a
new skill, I demand to be the best.

103
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:39,460
All right, let's get to servicing.

104
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,377
We'll service the crap out of them.

105
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:42,290
Yeah!

106
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:59,900
Do you want me no hold on?

107
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:01,120
Yes, I know!

108
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:05,817
No, I don't want you
to know what you want.

109
00:05:05,900 --> 00:05:11,677
Do you want me no hold on?

110
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,960
Yes, I know!

111
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,316
No, I want only you!

112
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:24,420
Oh

113
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:43,677
Well, you look rather decent,

114
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,997
though I suppose servant's
clothing would suit a commoner.

115
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,917
Oh, my stars, Miss Claire just
gave me a real compliment.

116
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,780
I was insulting you, you rube!

117
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,717
Well, Misha, what do you think?

118
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,400
Wow, it suits you perfectly, Prince Yu.

119
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:57,642
You look quite handsome as well.

120
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,700
Thank you.

121
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:00,880
That's very kind.

122
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,741
The shift schedule's posted here.

123
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:07,117
We rotate between prepping and serving.

124
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,318
We'll have to take turns for breaks.

125
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:13,180
Do you suppose we'll start
any time soon? Let's go!

126
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:14,840
I'm so ready for this!

127
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:22,537
Good afternoon, master, and welcome home!

128
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:24,317
Right this way.

129
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:26,697
Here you are.

130
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:29,797
Have you decided what you'd
like to order, master?

131
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,917
Of course, master.

132
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,437
I'll bring it right out.

133
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:37,197
Gentlemen, our finest plight of
roast beef sandwiches for you.

134
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:40,857
Has everything been to
your liking, master?

135
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,940
I do hope so.

136
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:54,260
Pardon, miss Claire, a
customer has requested you.

137
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:02,557
Don't keep your customer
waiting, miss Claire.

138
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:03,470
Yes!

139
00:08:03,553 --> 00:08:04,772
Instructor Lene, ma 'am!

140
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:06,640
I appreciate your patience.

141
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,877
Have you had sufficient time to decide?

142
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,880
Ah! He-he-he!

143
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:13,828
Look at you bottling the rage
in the name of professionalism!

144
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,920
What a gentleman!

145
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:21,140
Commoner, if you do not desist, I
will not hesitate to slap you! Really?

146
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,282
Do you promise?

147
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,240
Oh, never mind.

148
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:27,775
I nearly forgot I'm dealing
with a complete degenerate.

149
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:29,717
What would you like to order?

150
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,900
Let me see.

151
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:33,997
How about the sandwich and
creme brulee special, please?

152
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:37,315
And may I get you something
to drink with that as well?

153
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:39,342
Your tears on the rocks, please.

154
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,580
Do not test me, you little twit!

155
00:08:41,820 --> 00:08:43,877
What would you like to drink, Master?

156
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,497
May I recommend the hurry
and get out of my sight?

157
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:47,874
It's quite refreshing!

158
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:50,097
Maybe just black tea after the meal.

159
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:51,533
It will be my pleasure.

160
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,237
Oh, and I'd love a sight of
that Miss Claire sweet stuff.

161
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:56,261
I'm afraid we're all out of that.

162
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:59,077
And that'll be all for today, right?

163
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,580
You did a great job.

164
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,289
And now I shall pledge
your head as reward.

165
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,560
Pardon me.

166
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,760
Excuse me, miss.

167
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:09,455
Yes, what is it, sir?

168
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:12,340
Hi, can I add something
to my order, please?

169
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:15,077
You shall have your
vengeance one day, Claire.

170
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:15,990
Patience.

171
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,940
It's going so well.

172
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,167
Thank you for your patience.

173
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,673
Please come in, master.

174
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,657
Prince Yu, do you have a minute?

175
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:29,860
I really need to talk to you.

176
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,297
Please, I won't take...

177
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:34,060
We do not allow cutting in this line.

178
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,710
Matt!

179
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,700
We'll talk soon.

180
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,860
I promise.

181
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,960
I didn't expect it to be this busy Hello?

182
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:06,180
Some help, please? Coming!

183
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,817
Apologies for the work.

184
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:11,557
That took you long enough!

185
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:14,377
How dare you make His
Highness wait for service?

186
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:16,397
Do you have any idea who this man is?

187
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:19,517
Only the illustrious Crown
Prince of the Empire of Loro.

188
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,637
Behold, His Imperial
Highness, Marcel Loro!

189
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,597
You will take his order immediately.

190
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,840
Of course, sir.

191
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:29,220
I almost forgot about this guy.

192
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:32,562
If he stays true to the
game, this is gonna suck.

193
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,700
Bring me your finest
dish made with dodo bird.

194
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,720
His highness loves the dodo.

195
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,900
I knew it.

196
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:43,000
I hate to disappoint,

197
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:46,257
but I'm afraid we don't have
anything with dodo bird on our menu.

198
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:47,800
No, what's this?

199
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:51,197
If his highness wants dodo,
then you will bring it to him.

200
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:55,017
Believe me, sir, I wish I could,
but it's a very rare delicacy.

201
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:59,571
You're not likely to find Dodo served
anywhere in the entire of our kingdom.

202
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,160
This is the worst.

203
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:04,217
Prince Marcel shows up at
the Foundation Day Fair just

204
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:06,857
to be rude and make impossible
demands of the heroine.

205
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:09,237
He's only there as a
challenge in the game.

206
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:12,577
When played as intended, one of the
romanceable characters, a .k .a.

207
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:14,601
the princes, comes to her rescue.

208
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:19,517
And this is the part where I temporarily
regret not raising their affection levels.

209
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,797
It's so, so much worse, IRL.

210
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:25,777
Do you expect me to go out into the
wilderness and tackle a dodo for you to cook?

211
00:11:25,860 --> 00:11:29,557
Because if that's the case,
if I have to wrestle a dodo...

212
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:32,346
Please forgive my
interruption, Prince Marcel.

213
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,040
Miss Claire?

214
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:38,460
Ah, there is one among
you fluent in lower knees.

215
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,417
What is your name, young lady?

216
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,324
Claire Francois, Your Highness.

217
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:44,109
Might I make a suggestion?

218
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:47,760
We do serve an exotic dish
made with a very rare sauce.

219
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,840
For exclusive guests, that is.

220
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,420
This item is so rare.

221
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:55,377
Only a select few have ever
tasted it here in Bower.

222
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:57,677
I'm certain your highness will enjoy it.

223
00:11:57,760 --> 00:12:00,231
Very well, I'll trust your recommendation.

224
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:02,420
I am delighted to hear you say so.

225
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:04,880
Come, let's go.

226
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,757
Can you believe the
nerve of that narcissist?

227
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:13,677
This is why I can't stand
these new money monarchies.

228
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,819
Did you make note?

229
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:18,257
Pompous fools like him will
always cave if you butter them up.

230
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:19,752
That is valuable advice.

231
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,780
Roger that.

232
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,419
Thank you so much.

233
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:25,168
Not only for the advice,
but for helping me.

234
00:12:26,260 --> 00:12:29,517
Well, I certainly didn't do it for
you, if that's what you're implying.

235
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:32,757
Just go serve him his egg
sandwich and leave me to my rest.

236
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:36,277
Mayonnaise hasn't reached Loro yet,
so remind him that it's a delicacy.

237
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,190
On it!

238
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,230
What?

239
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,560
Oh, nothing.

240
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:47,547
I was just remembering
something, that's all.

241
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:54,060
Miss Claire, please.

242
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,908
I promise I'm fine
wearing the maid uniform.

243
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,529
Don't be ridiculous, Lene.

244
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:03,280
It's absolutely unacceptable for anyone
who serves me not to own a single gown.

245
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,960
Simply lovely.

246
00:13:05,260 --> 00:13:07,017
May we try this one on, please?

247
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:08,688
But of course, Miss Claire.

248
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:12,740
What is this?

249
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,120
Who allowed this commoner in here?

250
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:18,225
This is no place for your
kind to linger, girl.

251
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,340
Get out at once.

252
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:29,260
Pardon me a moment, but has my
servant done something imprudent?

253
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:32,320
Ah, fluent in Loranese at your age.

254
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:34,794
You must be receiving a fine education.

255
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:36,611
Thank you, Your Highness.

256
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:40,309
