295
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:54,467
It makes me sad to hear you talk
about yourself so negatively.

296
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:56,260
Excuse me?

297
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,224
I do not need your pity, you...

298
