299
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,700
Inviting you out.

300
00:16:07,940 --> 00:16:11,411
There's a whole fair out there
just waiting to be explored.

301
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:12,510
Please, Ms.

302
00:16:12,593 --> 00:16:14,674
Claire, it'd be an honor to escort you.

303
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,320
There's so much to do!

304
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,817
Where would you like to go first?

305
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,194
No food or drinks, thank you very much.

306
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:34,280
Not from here.

307
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:36,457
I refuse to pollute my body with junk.

308
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:37,370
Your loss!

309
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:39,500
Let's try this!

310
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:45,844
Is this one of your vile jokes?

311
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:47,337
Oh, I'm sorry, Miss Claire.

312
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:49,277
I almost forgot you're afraid of ghosts.

313
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,860
I'm not afraid, you fool.

314
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:55,217
I was simply taken aback by your
interest in something so juvenile.

315
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:56,130
Oh, good.

316
00:16:56,213 --> 00:16:57,231
Then you'll be just fine.

317
