328
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,697
How about I go get you something to drink?

329
00:17:36,780 --> 00:17:37,940
Yes, thank you.

330
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,960
But nothing silly or extravagant.

331
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:43,280
Water will do just fine. A tea!

332
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:58,440
Sign up to join a good cause!

333
00:17:59,700 --> 00:18:00,530
Excuse me?

334
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,417
You're Ray Taylor, aren't you?

335
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:06,877
The star commoner who got into the
Royal Academy at the top of her class?

336
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:09,737
Um, I guess so, yeah. My name is Matt.

337
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:12,437
