I wondered what was keeping you.

350
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:50,537
You shouldn't waste your
time on those idiots.

351
00:18:50,620 --> 00:18:54,208
The thing is, I don't think
their beliefs are idiotic at all.

352
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:55,330
I see.

353
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,497
You agree with them?

354
00:18:56,580 --> 00:18:57,410
Maybe.

355
00:18:57,493 --> 00:19:00,217
But it wouldn't matter to me if
I were a commoner or a noble.

356
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:02,065
I'd still prefer to serve you.

357
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:07,660
Oh yeah, I almost forgot. Here.

358
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:09,469
I wanted to give you this.

359
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:13,940
It's an amulet. Yes.

360
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:17,229
A charm to help you
find the love you seek.

361
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:21,299
I hope things work out
between you and Prince Thane.

362
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:25,869
You're as confusing as
you are frustrating.

363
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:30,097
As much as you might like
to tease and joke around,

364
