in the world would you choose me?

373
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:03,693
Because you're the one who
brought my heart back to life.

374
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:07,397
I worked myself to exhaustion every day.

375
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:10,537
My life was all about the next deadline.

376
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:13,277
I could barely breathe from the pressure.

377
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:15,717
And there was no way to escape!

378
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:18,600
But amid all that?

379
00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:32,580
It's hard to explain.

380
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:36,499
And chances are, you wouldn't
believe me if I tried.

381
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,140
But you rescued me.

382
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:44,357
Honestly, I have all the
absurd things for you to say.

383
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,322
Oh, never mind.

384
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:48,037
Clearly, you don't mean
to give me a real answer.

385
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,826
We ought to head back anyway.

386
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:50,810
Really?

387
00:20:50,893 --> 00:20:52,192
Isn't that late already?

388
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:53,780
In that case, Ms.

389
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,897
Claire, please give me your...

390
