391
00:20:56,940 --> 00:20:57,770
Huh?

392
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:01,980
You and I are a noble and a commoner.

393
00:21:02,580 --> 00:21:04,840
Nothing more, and nothing less.

394
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,220
Do you understand?

395
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:10,180
Do you really mean that? Let's go.

396
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,282
I don't want to return too late.

397
00:21:49,420 --> 00:21:52,220
Thank you.

398
