but it's not just the feeling that I'm
thinking I'm thinking about how you do it,

401
00:22:14,040 --> 00:22:15,360
it's a real thing.

402
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:18,917
I'm thinking that I'm gonna be a person.

403
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,797
When I'm thinking about your
heart, it's a big thing.

404
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:25,340
I don't even know what you've ever done.

405
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:29,300
I don't know what you've done.

406
00:22:53,260 --> 00:22:57,731
Ten sheets of parchment, two bottles
of ink, and one ball of leather thread.

407
00:22:58,540 --> 00:23:03,037
Seems like we got all we need
why do we have to do the shopping

